rked-solution "The vector components are $f_x$ and $f_y$. Integrate the first component with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as constant. Retain an arbitrary function $g(y)$ because its $x$-derivative is zero.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x,y)&=\\int\\bigl(- 2 x y + 2 y^{2} - 1\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm dx\\\\\n&=- x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} - x+g(y).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiate with respect to $y$ and match the second component:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf_y&=- x^{2} + 4 x y+g'(y)\\\\\ng'(y)&=\\bigl(- x^{2} + 4 x y\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad-\\bigl(- x^{2} + 4 x y\\bigr)\\\\\n&=0.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate the remaining function of $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ng(y)&=\\int\\bigl(0\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm dy\\\\\n&=0+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute to obtain\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=- x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} - x+C\n$$\n\nBoth components check:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf_x&=- 2 x y + 2 y^{2} - 1,\\\\\nf_y&=- x^{2} + 4 x y.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713172 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "09547fc6-c282-53e3-88c4-0112dbf3d816" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} - y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713170} {:answer/id #uuid "3e15e6a1-f903-52c0-9ebf-b2f7a876e1fc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=- x^{2} y - 2 x y^{2} - y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713178} {:answer/id #uuid "458079c4-6b30-5da2-9028-f65753e5cdc8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=x^{2} y - 2 x y^{2} - x - y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713179} {:answer/id #uuid "d28f8992-3542-5514-8063-f480988c41db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=- x^{2} y - 2 x y^{2} + y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713192} {:answer/id #uuid "ee64e89f-9fe2-5ac0-b3be-d76ec5cedb9a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} + x + y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713195}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ee64e89f-9fe2-5ac0-b3be-d76ec5cedb9a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} + x + y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713195} :answer-field/id #uuid "15360707-89a3-53ca-9de8-157179187c79" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713173}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "0bd36acb-8577-52d6-aa02-9385c5e17c7a" :question/problem "Find the general form of $f(x,y)$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\nabla f={}&\\bigl(2 x y + 2 y^{2} + 1\\bigr)\\,\\mathbf i\\\\\n&+\\bigl(x^{2} + 4 x y + 3 y^{2}\\bigr)\\,\\mathbf j.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWork on $\\mathbb R^2$.\n\nIn the choices, $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/worked-solution "The vector components are $f_x$ and $f_y$. Integrate the first component with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as constant. Retain an arbitrary function $g(y)$ because its $x$-derivative is zero.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x,y)&=\\int\\bigl(2 x y + 2 y^{2} + 1\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm dx\\\\\n&=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} + x+g(y).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiate with respect to $y$ and match the second component:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf_y&=x^{2} + 4 x y+g'(y)\\\\\ng'(y)&=\\bigl(x^{2} + 4 x y + 3 y^{2}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad-\\bigl(x^{2} + 4 x y\\bigr)\\\\\n&=3 y^{2}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate the remaining function of $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ng(y)&=\\int\\bigl(3 y^{2}\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm dy\\\\\n&=y^{3}+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute to obtain\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} + x + y^{3}+C\n$$\n\nBoth components check:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf_x&=2 x y + 2 y^{2} + 1,\\\\\nf_y&=x^{2} + 4 x y + 3 y^{2}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713177 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "095263c1-ac79-536a-acc7-0270dec44e79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=- x^{2} y - 2 x y^{2} - 2 x - y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713169} {:answer/id #uuid "0a7dccb7-7c5e-58f9-9888-1470bbc27f21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} + 2 x - y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713171} {:answer/id #uuid "2452ff1b-be8f-5d1c-b8e0-1cf111366b91" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} - 2 x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713175} {:answer/id #uuid "269c0ca5-9bc8-5bf7-b552-1d897366806d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} + y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713176} {:answer/id #uuid "bd34e82d-c98d-59c6-90fa-481d2a6a03a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=- x^{2} y - 2 x y^{2} - 2 x + y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713189}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0a7dccb7-7c5e-58f9-9888-1470bbc27f21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} + 2 x - y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713171} :answer-field/id #uuid "218057d6-3b1c-57f1-954a-49f743013549" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713174}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "3b684ae8-5980-5ef9-ac25-859f5fdd1fcb" :question/problem "Find the general form of $f(x,y)$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\nabla f={}&\\bigl(2 x y + 2 y^{2} + 2\\bigr)\\,\\mathbf i\\\\\n&+\\bigl(x^{2} + 4 x y - 3 y^{2}\\bigr)\\,\\mathbf j.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWork on $\\mathbb R^2$.\n\nIn the choices, $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/worked-solution "The vector components are $f_x$ and $f_y$. Integrate the first component with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as constant. Retain an arbitrary function $g(y)$ because its $x$-derivative is zero.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x,y)&=\\int\\bigl(2 x y + 2 y^{2} + 2\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm dx\\\\\n&=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} + 2 x+g(y).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiate with respect to $y$ and match the second component:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf_y&=x^{2} + 4 x y+g'(y)\\\\\ng'(y)&=\\bigl(x^{2} + 4 x y - 3 y^{2}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad-\\bigl(x^{2} + 4 x y\\bigr)\\\\\n&=- 3 y^{2}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate the remaining function of $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ng(y)&=\\int\\bigl(- 3 y^{2}\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm dy\\\\\n&=- y^{3}+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute to obtain\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} + 2 x - y^{3}+C\n$$\n\nBoth components check:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf_x&=2 x y + 2 y^{2} + 2,\\\\\nf_y&=x^{2} + 4 x y - 3 y^{2}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713184 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4cde3c42-fcbc-5082-a375-d1246f409614" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=- 2 x^{2} y + x y^{2} - 2 x - 2 y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713181} {:answer/id #uuid "4f752240-3c64-5d58-8b84-64e38c111ae3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=2 x^{2} y - x y^{2} - 2 x - 2 y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713182} {:answer/id #uuid "8003a629-b66b-572d-bbc7-86841c01f22e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=- 2 x^{2} y - x y^{2} - 2 x + 2 y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713185} {:answer/id #uuid "c7117469-b20a-519d-95a5-346313d56ee3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "f(x,y)=2 x^{2} y - x y^{2} - 2 x + 2 y^{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713190} {:answer/id #uuid "cdca15a8-7b89-51